          "name": "Order",
          "type": "DenseIndex"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "template<_Scalar,int _Dim,int _Degree> SplineTraits<Spline<_Scalar,_Dim,_Degree>>::DerivativeType Spline<_Scalar,_Dim,_Degree",
      "docs": "\\brief Evaluation of spline derivatives of up-to given order.\nThe function returns\n\\f{align*}\n\\frac{d^i}{du^i}C(u) & = \\sum_{i=0}^{n} \\frac{d^i}{du^i} N_{i,p}(u)P_i\n\\f}\nfor i ranging between 0 and order.\n\\param u Parameter \\f$u \\in [0;1]\\f$ at which the spline derivative is evaluated.\n\\param order The order up to which the derivatives are computed."
    },
    {
      "id": "basis-functions-89a3ee",
      "name": "basisFunctions",
      "category": "Spline",
      "signature": "basisFunctions(Target, U)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "Spline*"
        },
        {
          "name": "U",
          "type": "Scalar"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "template<_Scalar,int _Dim,int _Degree> SplineTraits<Spline<_Scalar,_Dim,_Degree>>::BasisVectorType Spline<_Scalar,_Dim,_Degree",
      "docs": "\\brief Computes the non-zero basis functions at the given site.\nSplines have local support and a point from their image is defined\nby exactly \\f$p+1\\f$ control points \\f$P_i\\f$ where \\f$p\\f$ is the\nspline degree.\nThis function computes the \\f$p+1\\f$ non-zero basis function values\nfor a given parameter value \\f$u\\f$. It returns\n\\f{align*}{\nN_{i,p}(u), \\hdots, N_{i+p+1,p}(u)\n\\f}\n\\param u Parameter \\f$u \\in [0;1]\\f$ at which the non-zero basis functions\nare computed."
    },
